{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Cthulhu Files</strong> is the official adaption of the internationally acclaimed gamebook series Choose Cthulhu, based on the original works from H.P. Lovecraft and the Cthulhu Mythos. The game will cover the different plots in the original gamebooks plus extra branches and brand new content exclusive for this game adaption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/02c92872ab306b0daf51426d1b8b70e6.poster.avif?t=1768150642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/02c92872ab306b0daf51426d1b8b70e6.webm?t=1768150642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/02c92872ab306b0daf51426d1b8b70e6.mp4?t=1768150642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a cosmic horror narrative where every decision counts and leads you to different endings. Will you have enough sanity to survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/846c6ddd56282d656c226194a40e1b90.avif?t=1768150642\" width=600 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While resting at home in Boston during the Christmas vacations, you receive an unexpected letter: Your great-uncle George Gamell Angell has died under strange circumstances, and you are his only heir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/ad50d7225b25f6b04e9fee064cf20574.poster.avif?t=1768150642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/ad50d7225b25f6b04e9fee064cf20574.webm?t=1768150642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/ad50d7225b25f6b04e9fee064cf20574.mp4?t=1768150642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are about to begin a terrifying investigation full of dangers, in which each mystery you unravel will bring you closer and closer to death or madness. Visit dozens of different locations and talk to a large variety of characters that will help you unravel the mysteries behind you uncle's death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover a mystery. Reveal the horror. Determine your destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/148ccfd5432a039fbd5a6f8b49d05739.avif?t=1768150642\" width=600 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More content: </strong>The official adaptation of the internationally acclaimed gamebook series Choose Cthulhu with more plots and brand new content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong>: The decisions you make will shape your future in ways you can't imagine. Every choice counts and will affect the story as you progress through the various plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore every single detail</strong>: Inspect the scenarios and take a closer look at elements that will reveal clues that will unlock new options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Madness</strong>: The perception of the environment changes when the player starts to lose sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: There are multiple branches that will lead you to multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cthulhu Mythos references</strong>: You will find multiple references to the Cthulhu mythos hidden in the scenes of the game that you can discover and complete collections that will unlock more content. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2960950?t=1768150642","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768150642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/a34448d08fb84fe401b9c5d2695597bcd8804212/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768150642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/a34448d08fb84fe401b9c5d2695597bcd8804212/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768150642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"In the game, the player can die or get insane due to the horrors discovered during the game. Monsters that can hurt and kill the player, accidental death due to traps, get insane and end in an asylum, are some of the adult contents the player can experiment."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Cthulhu Files</strong> is the official adaption of the internationally acclaimed gamebook series Choose Cthulhu, based on the original works from H.P. Lovecraft and the Cthulhu Mythos. The game will cover the different plots in the original gamebooks plus extra branches and brand new content exclusive for this game adaption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/02c92872ab306b0daf51426d1b8b70e6.poster.avif?t=1768150642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/02c92872ab306b0daf51426d1b8b70e6.webm?t=1768150642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/02c92872ab306b0daf51426d1b8b70e6.mp4?t=1768150642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a cosmic horror narrative where every decision counts and leads you to different endings. Will you have enough sanity to survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/846c6ddd56282d656c226194a40e1b90.avif?t=1768150642\" width=600 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While resting at home in Boston during the Christmas vacations, you receive an unexpected letter: Your great-uncle George Gamell Angell has died under strange circumstances, and you are his only heir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/ad50d7225b25f6b04e9fee064cf20574.poster.avif?t=1768150642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/ad50d7225b25f6b04e9fee064cf20574.webm?t=1768150642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/ad50d7225b25f6b04e9fee064cf20574.mp4?t=1768150642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are about to begin a terrifying investigation full of dangers, in which each mystery you unravel will bring you closer and closer to death or madness. Visit dozens of different locations and talk to a large variety of characters that will help you unravel the mysteries behind you uncle's death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Uncover a mystery. Reveal the horror. Determine your destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/extras/148ccfd5432a039fbd5a6f8b49d05739.avif?t=1768150642\" width=600 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More content: </strong>The official adaptation of the internationally acclaimed gamebook series Choose Cthulhu with more plots and brand new content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong>: The decisions you make will shape your future in ways you can't imagine. Every choice counts and will affect the story as you progress through the various plots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore every single detail</strong>: Inspect the scenarios and take a closer look at elements that will reveal clues that will unlock new options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Madness</strong>: The perception of the environment changes when the player starts to lose sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: There are multiple branches that will lead you to multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cthulhu Mythos references</strong>: You will find multiple references to the Cthulhu mythos hidden in the scenes of the game that you can discover and complete collections that will unlock more content. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Wildspell Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"hea