h_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960950/3a84a63e0ade7e2c49bc862d530c9015a9495de8/ss_3a84a63e0ade7e2c49bc862d530c9015a9495de8.600x338.jpg?t=1768150642"}],"short_description":"What if the choices you make during your investigation awaken ancient beings older than existence itself. Explore the official Choose Cthulhu gamebook adaptation, every decision you take seals the fate of mankind. Will the creeping madness consume you as you uncover the darkest secrets?","steam_appid":2960950,"support_info":{"email":"more@wildspellgames.com","url":"https://wildspellgames.com"},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":"https://ccfiles.net"}